# =================================================================
# ALLOW THESE (Override previous patterns if needed)
# =================================================================

# Keep example/template files
!examples/**
!templates/**

# Keep essential configuration templates
!.gitignore.example
!settings.json.example

# Keep README files
!**/README.md

# Keep documentation
!docs/**/*.md

# =================================================================
# NOTES
# =================================================================
#
# SECURITY CHECKLIST BEFORE COMMITTING:
# [ ] Checked for API keys in all files
# [ ] Verified no personal contact information
# [ ] Confirmed no credentials or passwords
# [ ] Reviewed git remote -v (is it private?)
# [ ] Ran: git diff --cached (review changes)
# [ ] Considered: Do I really need to commit this?
#
# SAFE TO COMMIT:
# - PAI.md (with placeholders, no personal data)
# - UFC.md (system structure only)
# - decisions.md and learnings.md (sanitized)
# - SKILLS-INDEX.md (with placeholder voice IDs)
# - Hook TypeScript files (no secrets)
# - Documentation and examples
#
# NEVER COMMIT:
# - .env files
# - API keys
# - Personal information
# - Contact data
# - Session logs
# - Credentials
#
# =================================================================
